\section{Canonical TSSE Unified Engine Kernel (TSSE-UEK)}

Define the TSSE Unified Engine Kernel:
\[
\mathcal{K}_{\text{TSSE-UEK}} =
\left(
H_{\text{TSSE}},\;
\mathcal{S}_{\text{TSSE}},\;
\mathcal{T},\;
\mathcal{U}_{\text{TSSE}}(t)
\right).
\]

It enforces:
\[
\mathcal{T}\mathcal{U}_{\text{TSSE}}(t)
=
\mathcal{U}_{\text{TSSE}}(t)\mathcal{T},
\qquad
\mathcal{U}_{\text{TSSE}}(t)^\top J\,\mathcal{U}_{\text{TSSE}}(t) = J,
\qquad
\mathcal{U}_{\text{TSSE}}(t)\mathcal{S}_{\text{TSSE}} = \mathcal{S}_{\text{TSSE}}.
\]

This kernel defines the complete unified TSSE engine architecture.

